#: ../../compatibility.rst:1
msgid "Compatibility with Sphinx"
msgstr ""

#: ../../compatibility.rst:4
msgid "Guidedog supports all of reStructuredText and all of Sphinx's built-in extensions. It supports them in its own way: the output serves the same purpose, but it is not identical to Sphinx's. Guidedog never runs Python, neither the configuration nor an extension. It measures compatibility feature by feature. **A successful build is evidence of a build, not proof of complete equivalence.**"
msgstr ""

